  "restContentHtml": "<p>The Halcyon Gallery has become known as one of Europe’s leading art galleries, representing some of the finest contemporary painters and sculptors.</p>\n<p>It was no surprise that they requested The Complete Restoration Company to restore their breathtaking Georgian staircase back to a work of art.</p>\n<p>All of the original features were completely covered with years and years of caked on paint, so it was necessary to restore the entire staircase in a considerate and fitting way.</p>\n<p>The cantilevered staircase was stripped of paint using the environmentally friendly <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/doff/\">Doff Cleaning System</a>, ensuring that only the paint was removed and the delicate limestone remained undamaged. We then honed back the limestone using diamond polishing pads and finally impregnated it with a limestone sealant.</p>\n<p>The cast and wrought iron balustrades were sand blasted to remove ugly layers of paint and then polished to make the most of the original finish. Finally, the mahogany handrail was stripped and re-polished by our expert French Polishing team.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignleft wp-image-1969 size-medium\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-300x201.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-300x201.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-768x514.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-1024x686.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-618x414.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-100x67.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /> <img class=\"alignleft wp-image-1968 size-medium\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-201x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-201x300.png 201w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-768x1148.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-685x1024.png 685w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-618x924.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-67x100.png 67w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1.png 934w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
  "restExcerptHtml": "<p>The Halcyon Gallery has become known as one of Europe’s leading art galleries, representing some of the finest contemporary painters and sculptors. It was no surprise that they requested The Complete Restoration Company to restore their breathtaking Georgian staircase back to a work of art. All of the original features were completely covered with years&#8230;.</p>\n",
  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n <div class=\"main-container\">\n<section class=\"row\" id=\"row_blog\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n    <div class=\"wrapper\">  \t\n\t<div id=\"primary-single\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n \t\t\t<article id=\"post-1671\" class=\"single-article complete-restoration-single-article\">\n                <img width=\"1672\" height=\"1116\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3.png 1672w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3-300x200.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3-768x513.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3-1024x683.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3-618x412.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img3-100x67.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\" />                \n\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title-single title align-center complete-restoration-single\">Halcyon Gallery</h1>\n                  <h2 class=\"entry-title align-center complete-restoration-single-h2\"> Situated in the heart of Mayfair</h2>\t\t\t\n        <div class=\"post-wrapper-single complete-restoarion-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Halcyon Gallery has become known as one of Europe’s leading art galleries, representing some of the finest contemporary painters and sculptors.</p>\n<p>It was no surprise that they requested The Complete Restoration Company to restore their breathtaking Georgian staircase back to a work of art.</p>\n<p>All of the original features were completely covered with years and years of caked on paint, so it was necessary to restore the entire staircase in a considerate and fitting way.</p>\n<p>The cantilevered staircase was stripped of paint using the environmentally friendly <a href=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/services/doff/\">Doff Cleaning System</a>, ensuring that only the paint was removed and the delicate limestone remained undamaged. We then honed back the limestone using diamond polishing pads and finally impregnated it with a limestone sealant.</p>\n<p>The cast and wrought iron balustrades were sand blasted to remove ugly layers of paint and then polished to make the most of the original finish. Finally, the mahogany handrail was stripped and re-polished by our expert French Polishing team.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignleft wp-image-1969 size-medium\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-300x201.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-300x201.png 300w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-768x514.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-1024x686.png 1024w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-618x414.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img2-100x67.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /> <img class=\"alignleft wp-image-1968 size-medium\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-201x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-201x300.png 201w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-768x1148.png 768w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-685x1024.png 685w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-618x924.png 618w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1-67x100.png 67w, https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Halcyon-img1.png 934w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t                 </div>\n\t\t\t</article>\n                <div class=\"wrapper divcontact\" > \n <div class=\"homformdetail\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/form_bricks.svg);no-repeat;cover;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n              <h2 id=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Get a quote today</h2>\n               <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f521-o1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/case-studies/halcyon-gallery/#wpcf7-f521-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form form-contact\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" id=\"form-contact\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"521\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.1.3\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f521-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-name\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"your-name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Name:\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap your-email\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"your-email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-validates-as-email enquiry-input\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"fals